## Session Continuity

Codex or Claude native session state is temporary. The durable recovery path is:

```text
.agent/sessions/active.md
  -> .agent/sessions/bootstrap.md
  -> current session handoff/context/changes/validation
  -> linked embedded spec change
  -> git status
```

